{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \n\nsignal peptide processing (GO:0006465) \nand subclass\nSRP-dependent cotranslational protein targeting to membrane, signal sequence processing (GO:0006618)\nplus\nprotein processing involved in protein targeting to mitochondrion (GO:0006627), \n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30479\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19J5MPbH1JzSL5b7azvQ1u-NSMTs0_GQSC_zv94yUs1M/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\n\nImpacted groups: \n[LIST GROUPS + NUMBER OF ANNOTATIONS + ADD ASSIGNEES] \n\nGO:0006465\n   5 CGD\t@jlewsmith \n  10 ComplexPortal\t @sandraorchard \n  5 EcoCyc\t@amandamackie \n   2 EcoliWiki\t@dsiegele \n   2 FlyBase\t@hattrill \n   6 GeneDB\t\n   2 HGNC-UCL\t@RLovering - done\n   1 MGI\t@LiNiMGI \n   1 PseudoCAP\n   1 Reactome\t@deustp01 \n  12 SGD\t@edwong57 \n\nGO:0006627\n   4 ComplexPortal\t@sandraorchard \n   1 MGI\t@LiNiMGI \n   1 PINC\t@pgaudet \n   1 RGD\t@gthayman \n   5 SGD\t@edwong57 \n   4 UniProt\t@Antonialock \n   1 dictyBase\t@pfey03 \n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n\n\n\n4 GO:0006465 unirule2go\n8 GO:0006465 interpro2go\n1 GO:0006465 reactome2GO\n1 GO:0006627 Interpro2go\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-07-03T13:38:32Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms", "mitochondrion"], "state": "open", "state_reason": "reopened", "title": "Review annotations to Obsolete : signal peptide processing (GO:0006465) protein processing involved in protein targeting to mitochondrion (GO:0006627), GO:0006618 SRP-dependent cotranslational protein targeting to membrane, signal sequence processing", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-01-05T16:08:20Z"}
